# Changelog Convention

When modifying any source file (.java, .ts, .tsx, .yml), also update `docs/SYSTEM_CONTEXT.md`:

1. Add a row to **Section 11 (Changelog)** with format: `| YYYY-MM-DD | Description of change | affected/files |`
2. If you added a new API endpoint, update **Section 4 (API Endpoints)**
3. If you added a new entity, update **Section 3 (Domain Entities)**
4. If you changed AI behavior, update **Section 5 (AI Integration)**
5. If you changed config, update **Section 7 (Configuration)**
6. If you found or fixed a bug, update **Section 12 (Known Issues)**
